message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the software."
title: "Automated Measurement of the Calcaneal Inclination Angle via Partial Semantic Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Interpretable deep-learning pipeline for automated measurement of the calcaneal
  inclination angle (CIA) on lateral weight-bearing foot radiographs, using three
  independently trained single-class U-Nets for partial semantic segmentation and
  deterministic landmark geometry.
